<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Responsible Teacher Assignment Update - SONAMONIDER PATHSHALA</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 32px 12px; background: #eef2f6; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
      <tr>
        <td style="background: #153e75; padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 4px solid #c9972b;">
          <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px;">SONAMONIDER PATHSHALA</h1>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #dbeafe; font-size: 13px;">STUDENT NOTIFICATION</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 32px; color: #334155; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">
          <h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #153e75;">Responsible Teacher Assignment Update</h2>
          <p>Dear <strong><%= studentName %></strong>,</p>
          <p>Your responsible teacher assignment for <strong><%= className %></strong> has been removed. Your former responsible teacher was <strong><%= teacherName %></strong>.</p>
          <p>Please contact the school administration if you have questions about your updated student support arrangements.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 28px;">Regards,<br /><strong>School Management</strong><br />SONAMONIDER PATHSHALA</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 20px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e8edf2; text-align: center; color: #64748b; font-size: 12px;">
          &copy; <%= year %> SONAMONIDER PATHSHALA. This is an automated notification.
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
